WEBVTT

00:00.933 --> 00:07.605
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.933 --> 00:07.605
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.669 --> 00:14.696
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.669 --> 00:14.696
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.281 --> 00:21.953
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.281 --> 00:21.953
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.978 --> 00:28.192
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.978 --> 00:28.192
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.086 --> 00:34.758
This surging power...

00:29.086 --> 00:34.758
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.086 --> 00:31.173
Black Jack

00:36.260 --> 00:42.515
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.260 --> 00:42.515
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.309 --> 00:48.271
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.309 --> 00:48.271
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.842 --> 00:57.197
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.842 --> 00:57.197
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.698 --> 00:59.389
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.389 --> 01:01.382
will be there

01:01.402 --> 01:04.362
It makes me glad...

01:01.402 --> 01:04.362
yokatta

01:04.607 --> 01:12.087
That I found my place here.

01:04.607 --> 01:12.087
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.140 --> 01:13.658
Oh WISDOM

01:13.658 --> 01:15.507
will be there

01:15.535 --> 01:18.176
I searched for the reason

01:15.535 --> 01:18.176
sagashita

01:18.177 --> 01:25.225
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.177 --> 01:25.225
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.770 --> 01:32.650
as long as we're alive.

01:25.770 --> 01:32.650
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.651 --> 01:34.736
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.820 --> 01:37.004
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.156 --> 01:39.767
His name is Black Jack.

01:57.945 --> 02:00.763
What a quiet and boring day.

02:04.862 --> 02:07.125
Why is yawning so contagious?

02:10.541 --> 02:12.514
First, the world news.

02:13.319 --> 02:17.141
Open warfare continues in Il.

02:17.882 --> 02:22.403
The capital has been subject to bombardment,
and many are without homes now.

02:23.513 --> 02:27.099
Their president has taken their
plight to the United Nations...

02:27.100 --> 02:29.684
and also issued a state of emergency
for the entire country...

02:29.727 --> 02:32.062
That country's having some trouble.

02:32.063 --> 02:36.587
It's hard to understand why people
would do that stuff at all.

02:36.943 --> 02:39.933
Unlike over there, this house is so quiet.

02:44.117 --> 02:45.784
It's too quiet.

02:45.785 --> 02:47.244
Something's not right.

02:47.245 --> 02:47.869
Could it be?!

02:51.207 --> 02:53.875
Hey. Hey. Knock before you come in.

02:53.876 --> 02:55.627
You're packing for a trip!

02:55.663 --> 02:56.559
To where?

02:56.717 --> 02:57.837
I'll come too!

02:58.840 --> 02:59.881
To Il.

02:59.966 --> 03:00.980
You can't come.

03:01.133 --> 03:02.921
I saw Il on the news.

03:03.094 --> 03:04.761
They're in the middle, of a war.

03:04.762 --> 03:05.595
Oh yeah?

03:05.596 --> 03:08.014
Then you know it's dangerous there.

03:08.724 --> 03:09.401
You're staying home.

03:09.559 --> 03:12.185
Stop joking about this!

03:12.186 --> 03:15.730
You mustn't go to a dangerous place like a war zone!

03:15.731 --> 03:18.818
As your wife, I won't allow it!

03:17.150 --> 03:18.817
A patient is waiting!

03:18.818 --> 03:20.476
I will go anywhere I'm asked to be.

03:20.945 --> 03:24.197
Besides, I'm a doctor, so I won't be on the battlefield.

03:27.285 --> 03:27.951
Hey! Largo!

03:31.122 --> 03:33.373
You can't have the tickets.

03:33.654 --> 03:35.041
Pinoco, please...

03:35.042 --> 03:38.920
They'll be Largo's lunch if you don't take me.

03:45.536 --> 03:48.680
Originally "The War Continues” by Tezuka Osamu

03:45.536 --> 03:48.680
The War Continues

03:50.480 --> 03:54.013
A few days later, Il

04:03.779 --> 04:05.947
The hotel should be around here.

04:10.828 --> 04:12.843
It's a real war zone.

04:20.867 --> 04:22.705
Just the two of you?

04:22.917 --> 04:23.370
Yes.

04:23.674 --> 04:25.392
For how long?

04:25.718 --> 04:26.718
I don't know yet.

04:26.719 --> 04:27.761
Depends on my job.

04:27.762 --> 04:28.727
I see.

04:31.349 --> 04:33.955
It's pretty here.

04:40.524 --> 04:42.734
B-Bye! See you!

04:44.362 --> 04:46.196
Pinoco, stay close to me.

04:52.453 --> 04:55.281
I've never tasted such yucky juice.

04:55.665 --> 04:58.541
It's so tense and nerve wracking around here.

04:58.542 --> 04:59.752
That's because there's a war.

05:00.002 --> 05:02.052
Now remember, don't leave this room.

05:02.380 --> 05:04.464
If you get hungry, send for room service.

05:04.465 --> 05:05.298
OK.

05:05.424 --> 05:07.499
You be careful too, Doc.

05:07.643 --> 05:09.913
Don't drink the water.

05:13.432 --> 05:14.641
This really is yucky.

05:18.354 --> 05:20.399
They are worth 50,000,000 total.

05:20.815 --> 05:23.131
It's literally our entire fortune.

05:23.567 --> 05:24.651
All right.

05:24.652 --> 05:26.027
But are you sure about this?

05:26.487 --> 05:27.555
I don't mind.

05:27.822 --> 05:31.781
Our entire fortune will end up
confiscated or stolen anyway.

05:31.993 --> 05:34.572
I just want my son to get better.

05:35.663 --> 05:38.729
My son Lunan has not been able to walk for months now.

05:42.295 --> 05:42.961
Yes.

05:43.587 --> 05:47.966
Lunan, this is the famous doctor who
came all the way from Japan.

05:50.094 --> 05:53.513
I'm sure he can make you better.

05:57.935 --> 05:58.949
Raise your leg.

06:04.483 --> 06:05.319
Now bend it.

06:09.071 --> 06:10.069
You can't bend it?

06:10.406 --> 06:11.068
No.

06:13.284 --> 06:14.811
Hunch your back.

06:15.161 --> 06:16.286
I can't.

06:19.832 --> 06:20.604
My back!

06:20.651 --> 06:21.289
Ouch!

06:22.293 --> 06:24.151
This is quite serious.

06:24.462 --> 06:26.616
He'll never be able to walk if we
go about this the wrong way.

06:28.799 --> 06:31.571
Your son has a herniated spinal disc.

06:32.136 --> 06:35.812
Part of the spine is bulging out and
putting pressure on the spinal cord.

06:36.682 --> 06:41.689
And because the spinal cord is pinched, the lower
body is paralyzed, and the leg nerves are numb.

06:44.315 --> 06:47.124
Your son has been in that state
for quite a while, hasn't he?

06:47.360 --> 06:50.577
He needs to go to a hospital for proper treatment.

06:50.988 --> 06:55.617
Hospitals in this town are already full of injured soldiers.

06:55.618 --> 06:58.411
Civilians will only be turned away.

06:59.747 --> 07:03.560
Right. We're only so far from where the war is.

07:03.876 --> 07:06.161
Doctor, will Lunan recover?

07:06.712 --> 07:09.839
I want him to get better soon so he can go fight.

07:10.716 --> 07:11.703
What?!

07:12.093 --> 07:19.426
As his mother, I feel ashamed that he is bedridden
while the whole country is fighting.

07:19.642 --> 07:20.976
Don't be ridiculous!

07:21.394 --> 07:23.978
So you're going to send him off
to war as soon as he's better?!

07:24.563 --> 07:25.770
Then what's the point of treating him?!

07:25.940 --> 07:27.781
I won't be a part of it!

07:28.192 --> 07:28.983
Please wait!

07:29.160 --> 07:31.215
There are reasons for it.

07:34.907 --> 07:37.113
My husband was a scientist.

07:37.868 --> 07:44.864
But because he was against the war,
he was captured and executed.

07:47.420 --> 07:54.256
Ever since then, I had hoped my son,
at least, would die as a war hero.

07:54.593 --> 07:56.378
Give up that hope.

07:56.637 --> 07:58.256
I came to heal a patient.

07:58.395 --> 08:00.181
Not send a boy off to war.

08:00.601 --> 08:01.326
Now you listen to me.

08:01.642 --> 08:04.477
If you value your son's life, keep him absolutely still.

08:05.646 --> 08:06.984
<i>What a mother.</i>

08:12.945 --> 08:15.697
All the soldiers are so young.

08:15.698 --> 08:17.365
I see some children in there too.

08:20.244 --> 08:24.747
I feel bad for them since they're
so small and have to fight..

08:24.748 --> 08:25.457
Yeah.

08:26.125 --> 08:29.586
Doc, why do people have wars?

08:29.587 --> 08:32.097
People get hurt and houses break too.

08:32.411 --> 08:33.882
It's a problem between governments.

08:33.883 --> 08:36.843
But the government is there for the people, right?

08:36.844 --> 08:38.344
It's not right.

08:38.552 --> 08:43.808
We keep losing men, so the age at which boys
are conscripted keeps getting lowered.

08:43.851 --> 08:50.063
The war better end soon, or we'll lose all our young men.

08:50.649 --> 08:53.109
You're against the war too?

08:54.720 --> 08:56.488
I didn't say that!

08:56.489 --> 08:57.198
Now, excuse me.

09:15.174 --> 09:19.469
Sheesh. Even after everyone in the
neighborhood has left to fight,

09:19.470 --> 09:21.179
you're still in here!

09:21.180 --> 09:22.221
How shameful!

09:22.681 --> 09:23.615
Now stand up!

09:23.849 --> 09:24.933
Get up and walk!

09:31.815 --> 09:33.347
Yes, that's it.

09:33.567 --> 09:37.362
You need to get used to this so
you can move around again.

09:42.785 --> 09:44.285
What a weakling!

09:45.079 --> 09:46.444
You need to have a stronger will!

09:46.789 --> 09:48.522
Now, stand up again!

09:52.086 --> 09:55.213
Mom, my legs are numb and my back hurts.

09:55.881 --> 09:56.936
Stop complaining!

09:57.341 --> 09:59.183
Now, walk along the wall!

10:07.977 --> 10:10.778
Mom, I can't go on.

10:11.313 --> 10:14.065
How can you be a hero like that?

10:14.942 --> 10:17.318
I don't need to be a hero!

10:17.319 --> 10:18.528
You don't understand!

10:19.196 --> 10:20.146
Now, get out!

10:40.968 --> 10:43.094
What have you done to your son?!

10:43.095 --> 10:45.220
I told you to keep him absolutely still!

10:45.514 --> 10:47.682
And you made him practice walking?!

10:47.683 --> 10:53.104
I was just training him so he could go to
the front line even if only a day sooner.

10:53.105 --> 10:57.138
Don't you understand that's making
his symptoms even worse?!

10:58.419 --> 11:00.695
I'm going to perform a biopsy now.

11:00.696 --> 11:02.071
Don't disturb me.

11:02.072 --> 11:03.156
Do you understand?!

11:03.157 --> 11:05.074
Do not get close to the patient's room!

11:05.909 --> 11:07.829
Lunan is my son.

11:08.322 --> 11:10.371
Then treat him like one!

11:10.748 --> 11:14.590
You may be a patriotic citizen,
but you're a terrible mother!

11:20.966 --> 11:22.345
It's getting worse.

11:22.926 --> 11:24.703
It's better if I don't recover.

11:25.095 --> 11:26.971
I'll just be sent off to war if I do anyway.

11:26.972 --> 11:28.463
Isn't my mom terrible?

11:28.849 --> 11:31.434
I'm sure she thinks I shouldn't even be alive.

11:31.583 --> 11:35.224
I've heard there were mothers like that
in Japan when we were last at war.

11:36.023 --> 11:38.358
What is your mother like?

11:47.159 --> 11:48.660
Is something wrong?

11:49.525 --> 11:50.134
No.

11:51.789 --> 11:54.807
My mother isn't around anymore.

11:56.335 --> 11:59.854
No matter what she's like, a mother is still a mother.

12:06.095 --> 12:08.104
A medical car from the hospital
will be in the area tomorrow.

12:08.555 --> 12:10.101
We'll take some x-rays then.

12:10.724 --> 12:14.018
Doctor, will I really get better?

12:14.133 --> 12:15.159
Yes. Certainly.

12:15.479 --> 12:16.979
That's why I came.

12:17.281 --> 12:19.363
You really are sincere.

12:19.817 --> 12:23.467
Would you mind getting the box on top of the cabinet?

12:25.489 --> 12:26.061
This one?

12:26.365 --> 12:26.998
Yes.

12:27.324 --> 12:28.640
How about here?

12:29.326 --> 12:30.243
Thank you.

12:31.554 --> 12:32.495
Doctor,

12:33.705 --> 12:35.164
would you please take this?

12:36.041 --> 12:37.148
For me?

12:37.376 --> 12:39.236
As my thanks for treating me so well.

12:39.819 --> 12:42.022
It's a child's doll that was made in this area.

12:42.554 --> 12:44.424
No matter how terrible our wars may be,

12:44.425 --> 12:47.604
children are still capable of growing up
and producing future generations.

12:47.928 --> 12:51.389
That's how humanity's managed to last this long, right?

12:59.279 --> 13:02.316
Mom! Didn't he tell you not to come in?

13:02.734 --> 13:04.038
What did you tell him?

13:04.403 --> 13:06.154
That it'd be better if you didn't recover?!

13:06.155 --> 13:07.155
How could you?!

13:07.656 --> 13:09.198
Who told you that?

13:09.199 --> 13:11.940
Say the wrong thing and people
will learn about it in no time!

13:12.828 --> 13:13.781
Now, get up!

13:14.621 --> 13:16.900
Get up and practice walking!

13:17.416 --> 13:18.597
Stop, Mom!

13:18.917 --> 13:19.876
Please!

13:19.877 --> 13:21.627
Don't be a coward!

13:21.628 --> 13:22.336
Do it!

13:22.337 --> 13:23.087
No!

13:24.089 --> 13:25.339
Stand up!

13:25.340 --> 13:26.306
Ouch!

13:34.391 --> 13:36.019
You moved the patient again?!

13:36.351 --> 13:38.269
Ma'am, I just can't watch this anymore!

13:38.812 --> 13:41.424
Do you want to save Lunan or kill him?!

13:41.690 --> 13:42.522
Which is it?!

13:45.483 --> 13:49.242
Doctor, you left this behind yesterday.

13:51.492 --> 13:52.649
This is what Lunan gave me.

13:57.206 --> 13:59.792
Doctor, don't get too involved.

14:01.001 --> 14:03.419
It's useless to treat her son.

14:04.087 --> 14:06.422
He'll just be sent off to war once he recovers.

14:06.625 --> 14:10.384
This country won't change just
because you saved one person.

14:13.013 --> 14:15.039
You're after their fortune, aren't you?

14:15.474 --> 14:17.924
A fortune of someone in this country
deserves to stay in this country.

14:18.227 --> 14:20.269
That doll better be all you're getting from him.

14:21.480 --> 14:23.731
How did you know they gave me a doll?

14:33.283 --> 14:35.313
That's just too terrible!

14:35.452 --> 14:40.164
I'd bite and kick, and ban a mom like that from any snacks!

14:40.165 --> 14:42.416
Does she hate her own son?

14:42.417 --> 14:45.449
He really needs an operation.

14:46.054 --> 14:48.756
And I'd better hurry because she's
only making his condition worse...

14:48.757 --> 14:50.125
Maybe I'll use epidural.

14:50.342 --> 14:51.717
I know!

14:51.718 --> 14:55.837
I'll come along and keep biting her so she won't interfere.

14:56.056 --> 15:00.059
Oh, though I guess I'd get scolded
and put under watch if I did that.

15:00.933 --> 15:01.693
Watch?

15:02.020 --> 15:04.772
That house is under surveillance.

15:04.773 --> 15:05.731
Who told you that?

15:05.732 --> 15:07.015
It was...

15:14.950 --> 15:16.793
You've been in this room the whole time, Missy?

15:17.035 --> 15:19.536
I'm not a kid, I'm his honey.

15:19.746 --> 15:22.224
My darling won't be happy if I go outside.

15:22.499 --> 15:25.459
I'm a good girl, so I do what he says.

15:30.076 --> 15:32.217
So your darling is a doctor?

15:32.259 --> 15:34.010
Yup!

15:34.011 --> 15:36.387
He's a great doctor!

15:36.388 --> 15:37.263
I see.

15:37.264 --> 15:41.267
I remember that their father was a prestigious scientist.

15:41.268 --> 15:43.686
You mean the patient's father?

15:43.687 --> 15:45.376
His name was Garuta-san.

15:45.647 --> 15:48.675
He was opposed to the war, so he
was captured and executed.

15:48.901 --> 15:51.527
Their house has been under surveillance ever since then.

15:51.613 --> 15:52.820
Surveillance?

15:52.821 --> 15:54.655
Who's watching the...

15:59.077 --> 16:00.290
Just as I thought.

16:00.787 --> 16:02.997
I've been misunderstanding things terribly.

16:12.132 --> 16:15.384
It cost quite a bit to get all these surgical tools.

16:15.423 --> 16:16.347
Sorry about that.

16:16.511 --> 16:19.108
But isn't it already too late?

16:19.473 --> 16:21.974
I will be grateful even if he doesn't recover.

16:22.935 --> 16:24.769
I'm going to disinfect the room.

16:24.770 --> 16:26.062
Please leave the room.

16:31.735 --> 16:32.788
Are you doing OK?

16:32.986 --> 16:34.000
I'm fine.

16:34.488 --> 16:36.572
Pinoco, give him Barbital.

16:36.573 --> 16:37.512
Then Fluothane.

16:37.741 --> 16:38.858
Aye-aye!

16:45.052 --> 16:46.343
Median incision.

16:55.175 --> 16:56.384
There it is.

16:57.010 --> 16:58.396
That's where the hernia is.

16:59.721 --> 17:01.925
Cut out a little more...

17:07.639 --> 17:08.813
Suturing.

17:12.109 --> 17:13.204
Operation complete.

17:13.610 --> 17:14.652
Put the braces back on.

17:27.374 --> 17:29.888
Doctor, how is he?

17:30.168 --> 17:33.921
Have him practice bending and stretching
his legs little by little every day.

17:34.673 --> 17:35.923
Will he get better?

17:35.924 --> 17:37.883
We're not done yet.

17:37.884 --> 17:38.884
One more thing.

17:41.054 --> 17:43.681
We still have something else we need to extract.

17:49.229 --> 17:50.272
What is it?

18:10.625 --> 18:13.345
The sound was very faint, but I found them.

18:13.804 --> 18:15.459
Those are listening devices.

18:15.459 --> 18:17.357
Ohmigewdness!

18:18.216 --> 18:20.950
I figured there'd be some if you were under surveillance.

18:21.553 --> 18:25.168
Ma'am, you can talk freely now.

18:25.474 --> 18:26.474
It must have been hard.

18:27.476 --> 18:33.314
It must have been very difficult having to say things
you didn't believe, lying even to yourself.

18:37.319 --> 18:39.803
This is a family known to have opposed the war.

18:40.197 --> 18:42.465
You're under surveillance and have been tapped 24/7.

18:42.866 --> 18:46.270
If you said anything wrong, you'd be arrested
immediately like your husband.

18:46.453 --> 18:53.111
That's why you were tricking them by lying about
how you wanted to send your son to war, right?

18:55.588 --> 19:02.468
And the reason she forced him to walk was so it'd take
longer for him to recover and be sent off to war, right?

19:02.469 --> 19:02.968
Yes,

19:03.970 --> 19:06.447
I'm so sorry about this.

19:06.806 --> 19:08.892
But I couldn't tell you.

19:09.309 --> 19:11.435
I was afraid that you'd tell someone else about this.

19:11.478 --> 19:13.453
I wish you'd have trusted me.

19:13.772 --> 19:15.940
I never jeopardize a patient's privacy.

19:15.941 --> 19:20.131
And I never leak my darling's secrets.

19:20.403 --> 19:21.111
Mom!

19:25.659 --> 19:27.000
Lunan! You...

19:27.285 --> 19:31.596
Mom, I misunderstood you.

19:33.458 --> 19:35.001
Hey! Don't push yourself!

19:35.252 --> 19:36.000
Lunan!

19:36.336 --> 19:37.378
Has it been hard?

19:37.379 --> 19:38.128
I'm sorry.

19:38.421 --> 19:40.172
I'm so sorry.

19:40.278 --> 19:42.424
But you don't have to push yourself anymore.

19:43.426 --> 19:44.637
Mom!

19:48.348 --> 19:51.029
Family is so nice.

19:51.393 --> 19:55.177
Now, let's put these back before they get suspicious.

20:04.990 --> 20:09.116
Man, even I couldn't do anything with such a bad case.

20:10.036 --> 20:13.247
I'm sorry that I could not provide a full recovery.

20:18.336 --> 20:19.801
Here's a medical certificate.

20:20.714 --> 20:23.317
This patient requires an extensive period of bed rest.

20:23.717 --> 20:25.509
Show this to them if he's drafted.

20:25.871 --> 20:27.970
And how long is this period?

20:28.722 --> 20:31.301
Until the war ends of course.

20:31.725 --> 20:33.434
Now, no need to stay here any longer.

20:33.435 --> 20:34.138
Doc, here.

20:34.436 --> 20:36.021
Doc, here.

20:36.354 --> 20:37.167
Right.

20:37.522 --> 20:41.523
Since l couldn't help him recover, I must
unfortunately return the payment.

20:43.945 --> 20:44.816
Doctor, please...

20:46.239 --> 20:50.451
Please accept at least this much.

21:04.216 --> 21:06.050
Sheesh, Largo!

21:06.051 --> 21:08.052
You're so lazy!

21:08.053 --> 21:14.124
Listen now, there are so many people
who are suffering because of war!

21:16.811 --> 21:18.643
Come on! Look at this!

21:19.940 --> 21:21.463
First, the world news.

21:21.816 --> 21:23.776
A developing story about Il.

21:26.613 --> 21:28.447
Ohmigewdness!

21:28.619 --> 21:30.101
It's Lunan!

21:31.910 --> 21:35.544
Doctor, I'm now able to walk because of you,

21:35.872 --> 21:38.228
but I was sent to war soon after.

21:38.750 --> 21:41.835
But I swear I will return alive.

21:42.963 --> 21:48.550
I will protect the chance at life you
gave me to the best of my ability.

21:52.931 --> 21:55.010
In any day and age, it's always the children who suffer...

21:55.266 --> 21:59.875
Lunan! Please come back alive!

22:10.541 --> 22:17.547
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.541 --> 22:17.547
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.548 --> 22:24.720
Only look straight at me.

22:17.548 --> 22:24.720
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.765 --> 22:32.022
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.765 --> 22:32.022
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.023 --> 22:42.532
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.023 --> 22:42.532
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.533 --> 22:47.913
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.533 --> 22:47.913
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.914 --> 22:57.297
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.914 --> 22:53.119
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.574 --> 22:57.298
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.298 --> 23:08.058
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.298 --> 23:08.058
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.059 --> 23:13.146
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.059 --> 23:13.146
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.147 --> 23:26.117
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.147 --> 23:26.117
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.118 --> 23:33.041
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.118 --> 23:33.041
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.042 --> 23:43.927
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.042 --> 23:36.975
sora no hate tooku

23:37.068 --> 23:43.868
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.073 --> 24:15.091
A Doll and A Policeman

23:45.233 --> 23:47.226
I got dumped today.

23:47.566 --> 23:48.739
Damn him!

23:49.073 --> 23:50.326
You ran a red light!

23:50.373 --> 23:51.700
You idiot!

23:51.760 --> 23:53.873
Good job on your traffic security work!

23:53.966 --> 23:54.459
Hey.

23:55.466 --> 23:56.093
Hey!

23:56.220 --> 23:57.833
Isn't there anyone?

23:58.133 --> 23:59.153
Who need a wife?

23:59.213 --> 24:00.253
Oh no!

24:00.278 --> 24:01.020
I'll arrest you!

24:01.093 --> 24:06.024
If you let me go, I'll treat you for
free when you do get hurt.

24:06.410 --> 24:07.604
It's going to be an major operation.

24:07.804 --> 24:11.644
He's still on the ground...

24:12.197 --> 24:14.437
Next Karte - A Doll and A Policeman.

24:16.165 --> 24:17.740
Karte NG...

24:21.754 --> 24:22.128
Huh?

24:22.917 --> 24:24.349
Man. It broke!
